                                <div class="event-details-content">
                                    <h3>Franchise Opportunities</h3>
                                    <p class="mb-4">
                                        We have every reason for you to enroll in our franchise model. An amazing opportunity for you to start you own Play School Franchise in India
                                    </p>
                                    <p class="mb-5">
                                        OPEN YOUR OWN PRESCHOOL — Franchise with Junior Kidz International. Become a Esteemed Junior Kidz Franchisee & Start a preschool!
                                    </p>
                                    <div class="franchise-intro-card" id="franchise-international">
                                        <h3>
                                            Franchise with Junior Kidz International
                                        </h3>
                                        <p class="franchise-card-subtitle">
                                            OPEN YOUR OWN PRESCHOOL
                                        </p>
                                        <ul class="franchise-card-list">
                                            <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i>5 yrs agreement period</li>
                                            <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i>No royalty</li>
                                            <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i>Complete online offline Support</li>
                                            <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i>Marketing Support</li>
                                            <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i>New technology Touch Screen learning</li>
                                            <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i>Teachers training Program for additional revenue</li>
                                            <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i>Guidance on After school Activities</li>
                                        </ul>
                                    </div>

                                    <div class="franchise-cards-container">
                                        <!-- 1. Our Academics -->
                                        <div class="franchise-section-card" id="academics">
                                            <div class="franchise-card-image">
                                                <img src="assets/img/franchise/academics.png" alt="Our Academics">
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="franchise-card-content">
                                                <h3 class="franchise-card-title">Our Academics</h3>
                                                <p class="franchise-card-subtitle">Simple and best</p>
                                                <ul class="franchise-card-list">
                                                    <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i>Robust pedagogy with continous updation</li>
                                                    <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i>Dynamic curriculum to foster multiple intelligences</li>
                                                    <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i>Interactive education tools and inviting learning infrastructure</li>
                                                    <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i>Curriculum in sync with all major education boards</li>
                                                </ul>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>

                                        <!-- 2. Our Support -->
