                                            </div>
                                            <div class="franchise-card-content">
                                                <h3 class="franchise-card-title">Our Support</h3>
                                                <p class="franchise-card-subtitle">Here to help</p>
                                                <ul class="franchise-card-list">
                                                    <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i>Ongoing updations, interactions, trainings and quality assistance</li>
                                                    <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i>Operational, academic & planning support, including various manuals</li>
                                                    <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i>Local marketing and brand support</li>
                                                    <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i>Efforts toward relationship building including affiliation with schools, parents and society at large</li>
                                                </ul>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>

                                        <!-- 3. Our Propositions -->
                                        <div class="franchise-section-card" id="propositions">
                                            <div class="franchise-card-image">
                                                 <img src="assets/img/franchise/propositions.png" alt="Our Academics">
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="franchise-card-content">
                                                <h3 class="franchise-card-title">Our Propositions</h3>
                                                <p class="franchise-card-subtitle">One window solution</p>
                                                <ul class="franchise-card-list">
                                                    <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i>Flexible business model</li>
                                                    <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i>Investor friendly location specific formats</li>
                                                    <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i>Associated programs to strengthen revenue</li>
                                                    <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i>Royalty holiday</li>
                                                </ul>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>

                                        <!-- 4. Franchise Requirements -->
                                        <div class="franchise-section-card" id="requirements">
                                            <div class="franchise-card-image">
                                               <img src="assets/img/franchise/franchise.png" alt="Our Academics">
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="franchise-card-content">
                                                <h3 class="franchise-card-title">Franchise Requirements</h3>
                                                <p class="franchise-card-subtitle">Joining the movement</p>
                                                <ul class="franchise-card-list">
                                                    <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i>Passionate and on way to be an entrepreneur</li>
                                                    <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i>Premises approximately 800-2000 Sq Ft</li>
                                                    <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i>Investment capacity of 7-10 lacs</li>
                                                    <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i>Exisiting education business owners and enthusiasts including preschools</li>
                                                </ul>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>

                                        <!-- 5. Student Kit -->
